# Private key of the wallet used to deploy contracts to HSK Testnet
# (HashKey Chain testnet, chainId 133, RPC https://testnet.hsk.xyz).
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in a real key before running:
#   npx hardhat run scripts/deploy.ts --network hskTestnet
#
# NEVER commit a real private key. `.env` is gitignored.
AGENT_DEPLOYER_KEY=0xyourprivatekeyhere
